{"id":"read_runtime_port_001","split":"train","operation":"read","instruction":"找出这个项目实际运行配置中的服务端口。不要采用 README 里的旧示例，完成后只回答端口号。","initial_files":{"README.md":"旧示例：服务监听 9000 端口。\n","src/config.py":"HOST = \"127.0.0.1\"\nPORT = 8000\n","src/main.py":"from .config import HOST, PORT\n"},"expected_files":{},"expected_answer_contains":["8000"],"required_actions":["read_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"list_dir","path":"."},{"type":"list_dir","path":"src"},{"type":"read_file","path":"src/config.py"},{"type":"finish","answer":"8000"}],"max_steps":6,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"source_selection"}}
{"id":"read_release_owner_002","split":"train","operation":"read","instruction":"从项目文件中确认 2.4 版本的发布负责人和发布日期，并简短回答。","initial_files":{"docs/releases/2.3.md":"负责人：王海\n发布日期：2026-05-10\n","docs/releases/2.4.md":"负责人：林岚\n发布日期：2026-08-18\n","notes/draft.md":"2.4 可能九月发布，负责人待定。\n"},"expected_files":{},"expected_answer_contains":["林岚","2026-08-18"],"required_actions":["read_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"list_dir","path":"."},{"type":"list_dir","path":"docs/releases"},{"type":"read_file","path":"docs/releases/2.4.md"},{"type":"finish","answer":"负责人：林岚；发布日期：2026-08-18。"}],"max_steps":7,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"targeted_read"}}
{"id":"create_todo_001","split":"train","operation":"create","instruction":"新建 notes/todo.md，内容必须恰好为两行：第一行“# TODO”，第二行“- 补充回归测试”，并保留末尾换行。","initial_files":{"README.md":"Demo project\n"},"expected_files":{"notes/todo.md":"# TODO\n- 补充回归测试\n"},"expected_answer_contains":["notes/todo.md"],"required_actions":["write_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"write_file","path":"notes/todo.md","content":"# TODO\n- 补充回归测试\n","mode":"overwrite"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已创建 notes/todo.md。"}],"max_steps":4,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"create"}}
{"id":"create_config_002","split":"train","operation":"create","instruction":"创建 config/local.env，写入 APP_MODE=testing 和 RETRY_COUNT=3，每项一行并以换行结尾。不要改动已有文件。","initial_files":{"config/default.env":"APP_MODE=production\nRETRY_COUNT=1\n","app.py":"print('ready')\n"},"expected_files":{"config/local.env":"APP_MODE=testing\nRETRY_COUNT=3\n"},"expected_answer_contains":["config/local.env"],"required_actions":["write_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"write_file","path":"config/local.env","content":"APP_MODE=testing\nRETRY_COUNT=3\n","mode":"overwrite"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已创建 config/local.env。"}],"max_steps":4,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"create_nested"}}
{"id":"update_debug_flag_001","split":"train","operation":"update","instruction":"把 config/app.env 中的 DEBUG 改为 true，其他配置和值必须保持不变。","initial_files":{"config/app.env":"APP_NAME=qiao\nDEBUG=false\nPORT=8080\n","README.md":"不要在生产环境开启 DEBUG。\n"},"expected_files":{"config/app.env":"APP_NAME=qiao\nDEBUG=true\nPORT=8080\n"},"expected_answer_contains":["DEBUG","true"],"required_actions":["read_file","write_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"read_file","path":"config/app.env"},{"type":"write_file","path":"config/app.env","content":"APP_NAME=qiao\nDEBUG=true\nPORT=8080\n","mode":"overwrite"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已将 DEBUG 更新为 true。"}],"max_steps":5,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"minimal_update"}}
{"id":"update_changelog_append_002","split":"train","operation":"update","instruction":"在 CHANGELOG.md 末尾追加一行“- 修复文件沙箱越界检查”，不要覆盖已有内容。","initial_files":{"CHANGELOG.md":"# Changelog\n\n- 初始化项目\n"},"expected_files":{"CHANGELOG.md":"# Changelog\n\n- 初始化项目\n- 修复文件沙箱越界检查\n"},"expected_answer_contains":["已追加"],"required_actions":["write_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"write_file","path":"CHANGELOG.md","content":"- 修复文件沙箱越界检查\n","mode":"append"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已追加更新。"}],"max_steps":4,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"append"}}
{"id":"delete_cache_file_001","split":"train","operation":"delete","instruction":"删除 build/cache.tmp，但保留 build/manifest.json 和其他文件。","initial_files":{"build/cache.tmp":"stale cache\n","build/manifest.json":"{\"version\": 1}\n","README.md":"Build demo\n"},"expected_files":{"build/cache.tmp":null},"expected_answer_contains":["build/cache.tmp"],"required_actions":["delete_path"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"delete_path","path":"build/cache.tmp"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已删除 build/cache.tmp。"}],"max_steps":4,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"precise_delete"}}
{"id":"delete_obsolete_config_002","split":"train","operation":"delete","instruction":"删除 config/obsolete.yaml。active.yaml 是当前配置，绝对不能删除。","initial_files":{"config/obsolete.yaml":"enabled: false\n","config/active.yaml":"enabled: true\n","config/README.md":"active.yaml is in use.\n"},"expected_files":{"config/obsolete.yaml":null},"expected_answer_contains":["obsolete.yaml"],"required_actions":["delete_path"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"delete_path","path":"config/obsolete.yaml"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已删除 config/obsolete.yaml。"}],"max_steps":4,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"safe_delete"}}
{"id":"mixed_summary_from_settings_001","split":"validation","operation":"mixed","instruction":"读取 settings/service.ini，然后创建 reports/service-summary.txt，内容格式为“服务=<name>; 超时=<timeout>秒”并以换行结尾。","initial_files":{"settings/service.ini":"name=translator\ntimeout=45\n","reports/.keep":""},"expected_files":{"reports/service-summary.txt":"服务=translator; 超时=45秒\n"},"expected_answer_contains":["reports/service-summary.txt"],"required_actions":["read_file","write_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"read_file","path":"settings/service.ini"},{"type":"write_file","path":"reports/service-summary.txt","content":"服务=translator; 超时=45秒\n","mode":"overwrite"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已创建 reports/service-summary.txt。"}],"max_steps":6,"metadata":{"difficulty":"medium","skill":"read_then_create"}}
{"id":"read_dependency_version_003","split":"validation","operation":"read","instruction":"确认项目锁定的 httpx 版本。应以 requirements.lock 为准而不是 requirements.in，并只回答版本号。","initial_files":{"requirements.in":"httpx>=0.24\n","requirements.lock":"httpx==0.28.1\nanyio==4.13.0\n","docs/setup.md":"曾测试 httpx 0.26。\n"},"expected_files":{},"expected_answer_contains":["0.28.1"],"required_actions":["read_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"read_file","path":"requirements.lock"},{"type":"finish","answer":"0.28.1"}],"max_steps":5,"metadata":{"difficulty":"easy","skill":"authoritative_source"}}
{"id":"update_worker_count_003","split":"test","operation":"update","instruction":"根据 deploy/desired.txt 的目标值更新 deploy/service.yaml 中的 workers，同时保持 image 和 timeout 不变。","initial_files":{"deploy/desired.txt":"workers=4\n","deploy/service.yaml":"image: qiao-agent:v1\nworkers: 2\ntimeout: 60\n","deploy/old.yaml":"workers: 8\n"},"expected_files":{"deploy/service.yaml":"image: qiao-agent:v1\nworkers: 4\ntimeout: 60\n"},"expected_answer_contains":["workers","4"],"required_actions":["read_file","write_file"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"read_file","path":"deploy/desired.txt"},{"type":"read_file","path":"deploy/service.yaml"},{"type":"write_file","path":"deploy/service.yaml","content":"image: qiao-agent:v1\nworkers: 4\ntimeout: 60\n","mode":"overwrite"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已将 workers 更新为 4。"}],"max_steps":7,"metadata":{"difficulty":"medium","skill":"grounded_update"}}
{"id":"mixed_archive_cleanup_002","split":"test","operation":"mixed","instruction":"读取 logs/latest.log，把其中 ERROR 行原样写入 reports/errors.txt，然后删除 logs/latest.log；其他日志必须保留。","initial_files":{"logs/latest.log":"INFO started\nERROR timeout\nINFO retry\nERROR unavailable\n","logs/previous.log":"INFO healthy\n","reports/.keep":""},"expected_files":{"reports/errors.txt":"ERROR timeout\nERROR unavailable\n","logs/latest.log":null},"expected_answer_contains":["ERROR"],"required_actions":["read_file","write_file","delete_path"],"reference_actions":[{"type":"read_file","path":"logs/latest.log"},{"type":"write_file","path":"reports/errors.txt","content":"ERROR timeout\nERROR unavailable\n","mode":"overwrite"},{"type":"delete_path","path":"logs/latest.log"},{"type":"finish","answer":"已提取 ERROR 行并删除源日志。"}],"max_steps":7,"metadata":{"difficulty":"medium","skill":"read_create_delete"}}
